---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const title = 'About Tanka — An independent digital currency project';
const description = 'Learn about Tanka, an open-source cryptocurrency project in development for everyday payments and community participation.';
---
<SiteLayout title={title} description={description} active="/about/"><section class="container py-20 sm:py-28"><p class="eyebrow">About Tanka</p><h1 class="display mt-5 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-medium leading-tight sm:text-7xl">A different kind of<br /><span class="text-cyan">money conversation.</span></h1><p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-silver/65">Tanka is an independent, open-source cryptocurrency project exploring a mineable digital currency for everyday payments and community participation.</p><div class="mt-16 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><article class="panel rounded-2xl p-7"><span class="eyebrow">Our starting point</span><h2 class="display mt-5 text-2xl">Useful by intention</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-silver/65">Tanka's purpose is to explore digital money around ordinary needs: access, participation, and the possibility of paying one another directly.</p></article><article class="panel rounded-2xl p-7"><span class="eyebrow">Our approach</span><h2 class="display mt-5 text-2xl">Open as we build</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-silver/65">The project is under active development. Progress, plans, and code belong in the open, with clear communication about what exists and what is still ahead.</p></article></div><p class="mt-9 text-sm text-silver/45">The Tanka network, mining, wallet, exchange listings, and merchant services are not currently operational.</p></section></SiteLayout>
